cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite the version you used."
type: software
title: "Solenoid Calculator"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
authors:
  - family-names: Adams
    given-names: Michael P.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9269-8087"
abstract: >-
  Solenoid Calculator is a tested Python implementation for estimating winding
  geometry, DC ohmic resistance, DC inductance, ideal series impedance, and
  axial magnetic flux density for thick cylindrical air-core solenoids. It
  includes documented reference cases and a browser-native interface based on
  a homogeneous azimuthal current-density model.
keywords:
  - solenoids
  - electromagnetic coils
  - magnetostatics
  - inductance
  - magnetic flux density
  - scientific software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AdamsMP92/SolenoidCalculator"
url: "https://adamsmp92.github.io/SolenoidCalculator/"
